  "description": "Tier A interior kit for vanilla farmhouse cells (decision 0103 decision 3): the interior tileset pieces, furniture, containers, clutter, carried items and light-bearing meshes that the tier A cells claimed on published places reference, and that no other published kit already holds. The set is read from the cells themselves by `worldgen.export_interior_bundle` (every `no-kit-asset` gap of a claimed cell), never picked by name. First cell: Skyrim.esm DawnstarBrinasHouse, the claim on Claywater Station's station house (farmhouse01). A later claim adds its gaps here and rebuilds. The full farmhouse interior tileset (`vanilla-farmhouse-int`, 76 pieces including the basement family) stays an unbuilt config for Phase 12's assembled interiors.",
